span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-11T12:20:02-07:00","id":254515,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dude of Legend</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/252814-5-rpgs?p=254499#post254499\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>1. Hunter the Vigil<br /> 2. Hunter the Reckoning<br /> 3. Hunters Hunted 2</b><br /> 4. Shadowrun<br /> 5. Marvel Superheroes</div> </div> </div> </div>I see a theme there. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-11T12:33:43-07:00","id":254524,"title":"","content":"1. Dungeons &amp; Dragons 3.5 (It was my first tabletop game, and I think it's still the one I spent the most hours on to date)<br /> 2. Exalted 3rd Edition (Yes, I know it's not out, but my expectations are high)<br /> 3. Unknown Armies<br /> 4. Wild Talents 2nd Edition (Cheating a little here - I really like Godlike, eCollapse, Better Angels, and other one-roll engine games, but since I can't pick them out individually, I'll take the system I can use to emulate them all.)<br /> 5. Paranoia XP (The only TTRPG I know where Rule Zero is emphasized to the point where practically nothing else matters, and a total party wipe can be very enjoyable for all participants.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":908,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","user":"semicasual","date":". 09-11-2014, 03:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-11T17:24:32-07:00","id":254843,"title":"","content":"Werewolf: the Apocalypse 2nd ed<br /> Vampire: the Masquerade 2nd ed<br /> Paranoia<br /> Call of Cthulu<br /> D&amp;D 3.5","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3841-herne","name":"Herne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3841_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T21:30:52-07:00","id":256465,"title":"","content":"In no particular order...<br /> <br /> Vampire: the Masquerade 20th Anniversary Edition<br /> Werewolf: the Apocalypse 20th Anniversary Edition<br /> Savage Worlds Deluxe Corebook<br /> Legend of the Five Rings 4th Edition<br /> Dungeons &amp; Dragons Rules Cyclopedia (Which covers Basic, Expert, Companion, Master, and Immortal Rules)<br /> <br /> Oh yeah!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2910-gideonhelmsley","name":"GideonHelmsley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-22T03:44:38-07:00","id":262752,"title":"","content":"1. Exalted<br /> 2. Dark Ages Vampire<br /> 3. Ars Magica<br /> 4. Dark Heresy<br /> 5. Anima: Beyond Fantasy","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2435-prophet","name":"Prophet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2435_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"329"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}